--[[
    Level 13 - Starfall
    A broken observatory floating in space. New: gravity orbs. Touching a
    cyan orb (u) flips gravity UP: the ball falls up, rolls along ceilings
    and jumps downward. A yellow orb (n) flips it back. Checkpoints always
    bring normal gravity back. Drift off the top or bottom and you pop.
    Enemies don't flip. Big falling up smashes cracked ceilings.

    1. first flip: roll on the ceiling over a spike floor
    2. zigzag tunnel: floor, ceiling, floor, ceiling - spikes on both
    3. ceiling smash: flip up as Big through the cracked ceiling, grab the
       key in the hidden room, drop back down through the hole
    4. the dome: flip between floating islands (keep rolling the right way!)
    5. platform crossing over the drop
    6. final tower: up to an overhang, down to a ledge, up again ... then
       the key door and the flag at the top

    Legend:  . empty   # rock   C cracked rock   ^ spikes   v ceiling spikes
             u orb: gravity up   n orb: gravity down   P pump   * gem
             E slug   B spark star   S start   G goal   H checkpoint
             K key   D locked door
    platforms = { col, row, len, toCol, toRow, speed, wake, group }
]]

